---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/siteConfig";
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Bull or Bear Blogs is a platform dedicated to simplifying personal finance, investing, and wealth creation for everyday people."
>
	<Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: "About" }]} />

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">About {siteConfig.name}</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-body prose-a:font-semibold prose-a:text-primary prose-li:text-body dark:prose-invert">
			<p>
				Welcome to {siteConfig.name} — a platform dedicated to simplifying personal finance,
				investing, and wealth creation for everyday people. Our goal is to make financial education
				simple, practical, and accessible. We believe financial literacy is one of the most
				important life skills, yet most people are never properly taught how money, investing,
				budgeting, or wealth-building actually work.
			</p>
			<h2>Our mission</h2>
			<p>Our mission is to help people:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Make smarter financial decisions</li>
				<li>Avoid common money mistakes</li>
				<li>Understand investing and personal finance</li>
				<li>Build long-term wealth</li>
				<li>Improve financial discipline and awareness</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We write across <strong>World</strong>, <strong>Money</strong>, <strong>Finance</strong>, <strong>Personal Finance</strong>, <strong>Politics</strong>, <strong>Business</strong>, <strong>Tech</strong>, <strong>AI</strong>, and <strong>Lifestyle</strong> — covering financial planning, budgeting, investing, mutual funds, SIPs, trading psychology, credit cards, and the economic and political stories that move markets.
			</p>
			<h2>Why {siteConfig.name}?</h2>
			<p>
				The financial world is filled with confusing jargon, misinformation, and emotionally-driven
				advice. {siteConfig.name} was created to break down complex financial topics into
				easy-to-understand content that actually helps readers take action — whether you're a
				beginner starting your financial journey or someone looking to sharpen your money
				management skills.
			</p>
			<h2>What we're not</h2>
			<p>
				We're not a licensed investment, legal, or tax advisor, and nothing on this site is
				financial advice. Our content is created through research, analysis, and educational
				interpretation of publicly available financial information. Readers are encouraged to do
				their own research and consult certified professionals before making financial or
				investment decisions.
			</p>
			<h2>Get in touch</h2>
			<p>
				Have a tip, a correction, or a topic you think we're missing? <a href="/contact/">Reach out</a>
				 — we read everything.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
